IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gaa-instruments`

-- Guardianship and Administration Act 1990 (WA), Parts 9, 9A and 9B, ss 45, 110ZJ, 119 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_guardianship-and-administration-act-1990.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario facts used (workbench scenarios/au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*/facts.json): Chloe born 2003-03-14, turns 18 on 2021-03-14
-- (c025); Liam born 1999-07-22, Oliver 2030-09-05, Ella 2033-04-12; enduring powers of attorney 2041-02-14 (c082, Chloe 37,
-- Liam 41, Oliver 10, Ella 7); enduring guardians 2063-03-14 (c091, Chloe 60, Oliver 32, Ella 29); a directive 2073-03-14 (c095,
-- Chloe 70). Jake born 2006-08-30, a stroke 2063-03-14 (k090), an enduring power of attorney and guardianship to Ruby (born
-- 2033-01-22) 2063-05-15 (k092, Jake 56), a directive 2075-04-02 (k096, Jake 68). Daniel born 1996-04-09: enduring powers
-- 2065-04-09 (d085, 69), a directive 2074-06-12 (d090, 78). Whether Jake had full legal capacity after his stroke is not
-- stated by the scenario; both answers are asserted.

§ `Fixtures`

`Chloe's power to Liam, executed as the Act requires` MEANS AttorneyInstrument WITH
    `in the form or substantially in the form of Form 1` IS TRUE
    `declares it continues despite later incapacity` IS TRUE
    `declares it is in force only while a section 106 declaration is in force` IS FALSE
    `attesting witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other attesting witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 1
    `statement of acceptance executed by every donee` IS TRUE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS FALSE
    `statement of acceptance executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

`a power witnessed by an authorised witness and the donee` MEANS AttorneyInstrument WITH
    `in the form or substantially in the form of Form 1` IS TRUE
    `declares it continues despite later incapacity` IS TRUE
    `declares it is in force only while a section 106 declaration is in force` IS FALSE
    `attesting witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other attesting witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 0
    `statement of acceptance executed by every donee` IS TRUE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS FALSE
    `statement of acceptance executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

`a power witnessed by two witnesses authorised to take declarations` MEANS AttorneyInstrument WITH
    `in the form or substantially in the form of Form 1` IS TRUE
    `declares it continues despite later incapacity` IS TRUE
    `declares it is in force only while a section 106 declaration is in force` IS FALSE
    `attesting witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 2
    `other attesting witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 0
    `statement of acceptance executed by every donee` IS TRUE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS FALSE
    `statement of acceptance executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

`a power without the donee's statement of acceptance` MEANS AttorneyInstrument WITH
    `in the form or substantially in the form of Form 1` IS TRUE
    `declares it continues despite later incapacity` IS TRUE
    `declares it is in force only while a section 106 declaration is in force` IS FALSE
    `attesting witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other attesting witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 1
    `statement of acceptance executed by every donee` IS FALSE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS FALSE
    `statement of acceptance executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

`a power naming a substitute who has not signed an acceptance` MEANS AttorneyInstrument WITH
    `in the form or substantially in the form of Form 1` IS TRUE
    `declares it continues despite later incapacity` IS TRUE
    `declares it is in force only while a section 106 declaration is in force` IS FALSE
    `attesting witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other attesting witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 1
    `statement of acceptance executed by every donee` IS TRUE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS TRUE
    `statement of acceptance executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

`Chloe's enduring power of guardianship to Oliver and Ella` MEANS GuardianshipInstrument WITH
