    `signed by the appointor, or for them in their presence and at their direction` IS TRUE
    `appointor's signature -- witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `appointor's signature -- other adult witnesses who are not the appointor, the signer or an appointee` IS 1
    `those witnesses signed in the presence of the appointor, any signer and each other` IS TRUE
    `signed by every appointee to accept` IS FALSE
    `appointee's signature -- witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `appointee's signature -- other adult witnesses who are not the appointor, the signer or an appointee` IS 1
    `those witnesses signed in the presence of the appointee and each other` IS TRUE

`Chloe's directive at seventy` MEANS Directive WITH
    `in the prescribed form or substantially so` IS TRUE
    `the maker was encouraged to seek legal or medical advice` IS TRUE
    `signed by the maker, or for them in their presence and at their direction` IS TRUE
    `witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other adult witnesses who are not the maker or the signer` IS 1
    `the witnesses signed in the presence of the maker, any signer and each other` IS TRUE

`a directive whose maker was never encouraged to seek advice` MEANS Directive WITH
