§ `helpers -- ages from the lives`

#ASSERT `age in completed years` 2003 3 14 2021 3 14 EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `age in completed years` 2003 3 14 2021 3 13 EQUALS 17
#ASSERT `age in completed years` 2033 1 22 2063 5 15 EQUALS 30

