§ `ss 110F, 110G, 45 -- what an enduring guardian may decide (c091)`

#ASSERT `the enduring guardian may make the decision` `where the appointor lives` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the enduring guardian may make the decision` `where the appointor lives` FALSE FALSE
